<p>This is my second SCP, I hope you’ll enjoy it.</p>
<p><strong>Thanks:</strong></p>
<p>Firstly, my heartfelt thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rumetzen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(209204); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=209204&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="rumetzen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=209204)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rumetzen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(209204); return false;">rumetzen</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mayoculpa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3489662); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3489662&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="mayoculpa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3489662)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mayoculpa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3489662); return false;">mayoculpa</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2858989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="Westrin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2858989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;">Westrin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/baronjoe" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3376201); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3376201&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="Baronjoe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3376201)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/baronjoe" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3376201); return false;">Baronjoe</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;">MrWrong</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414765); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414765); return false;">Doctor Cimmerian</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1956625&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="DrChandra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1956625)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;">DrChandra</a></span> for reviewing this as a draft; and especially to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2156983); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2156983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="psul" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2156983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2156983); return false;">psul</a></span>, for providing some extremely detailed feedback on this and helping me tighten up the writing and get the internal logic of the piece right, and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/petrograd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(455145); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=455145&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="Petrograd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=455145)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/petrograd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(455145); return false;">Petrograd</a></span>, for reviewing several versions of the draft and letting me bug him by PM with my questions. Thanks also to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(778357); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(778357); return false;">ProcyonLotor</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/accelerando" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1599414); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1599414&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="Accelerando" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1599414)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/accelerando" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1599414); return false;">Accelerando</a></span> for their help with image licensing issues, and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span> for helping me get this reviewed in chat.</p>
<p>Many thanks also to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wils" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2096532); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2096532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1532376744" alt="Wils" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2096532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wils" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2096532); return false;">Wils</a></span>, for allowing me to use his concept of Anomalous Signature Recognition algorithms, which is featured in the tale <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/7-degrees-of-separation">7 Degrees of Separation</a>. The tale is part of the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/at-the-library">Harold Maine</a> tale series which revolves around <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2982">SCP-2982</a>, and which you should definitely check out if you like gripping, twisted narratives and sickeningly-evil villains.</p>
<p><strong>Image Attribution:</strong></p>
<p>A huge thanks to <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/gmcmullen/">Greg McMullen</a>, who graciously agreed to change the license of <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/gmcmullen/326528792/in/photolist-uRxCL-pWJGNt-5Ns6PJ-vrGs4-UdzFwT-99HkdQ-pCxUUQ-4aAPCk-KY9Z8-5GdwN8-7ttrNk-7qYM7A-vmthM-qhZyes-qxgnUQ-4edNR2-KYktk-4fAmdG-b2Tb3K-iM93Sr-qd1i2E-ecmPxV-4cQ97a-4fe9dg-5Rw97P-94N7uv-b1ov6c-B2NQ-4fDKgu-5LW6Uz-7MrGL-8dYAU-5Hs4hb-4T4Szn-4c72HC-4fe866-sdAYg-b1vaP4-jZoLR6-pixQs7-b2TsMR-8EBs15-5J7mgV-5xnMin-jZoP3k-jZnU2c-CufnHm-4eePB5-aV48UH-igVBE">his image</a> to CC BY-SA 2.0, so that it would be compatible with this wiki. The image was modified by me, using <a href="https://pixabay.com/en/walkers-autumn-fog-man-human-mood-486583/">this CC0 Creative Commons image</a>.</p>
<p>The second image was made by me, using <a href="https://pixabay.com/en/fingerprint-traces-pattern-456486/">this image</a> and <a href="https://pixabay.com/en/old-paper-vintage-coffee-stain-2228749/">this image</a>, both of which were also released under the CC0 Creative Commons license.</p>
<p>Whoo, I think that’s it. Enjoy the skip, and thanks for reading! :)</p>

